  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "The Eclipse Bridge is a canonical bridge enabling asset transfers between Ethereum and the Eclipse blockchain. It uses a lock-and-mint mechanism where assets are locked on Ethereum and minted on Eclipse, with a Treasury contract managing locked funds.",
